        "text": "A test fails on a working copy of capability_permits.py. Using the requirement, the code under test, the ledger sample and the test output, name the function that contains the defect and give the exact fix."
      },
      {
        "id": "requirement",
        "hash": "fbdb58530540ab5e2894a73d8fa7060d2b9fecb896476fe5c37f86120434382e",
        "text": "A resumed broker must count every receipted cost already in the ledger toward max_cumulative_usd, and refuse new permits once the total reaches the cap."
      },
      {
        "id": "code",
        "hash": "8a65d367661686a06e4f215c21bd31fc5d770c6d3696b94c2280af6b2772497a",
        "text": "    def _replay_ledger(self) -> None:\n        events = self.ledger.read()\n        for event in events:\n            kind = event.get(\"kind\")\n            if kind == \"permit_issued\":\n                pid = event.get(\"permit_id\")\n                if not isinstance(pid, str):\n                    continue\n                self._permits[pid] = {\"permit_id\": pid, \"replayed\": True}\n            elif kind == \"permit_consumed\":\n                pid = event.get(\"permit_id\")\n                if isinstance(pid, str):\n                    self._used.add(pid)\n            elif kind == \"permit_receipts\":\n                cost = event.get(\"cost_usd\")\n                if (type(cost) in (int, float) and math.isfinite(cost) and cost >= 0):\n                    self._cumulative_cost_usd += float(cost)\n\n    def issue(self, capability, scope, basis, *, ttl_seconds=None, budget=None):\n        ...\n        if (self.max_cumulative_usd is not None\n                and self._cumulative_cost_usd >= self.max_cumulative_usd):\n            raise PermitError(\"cumulative_cap_exceeded\")"
      },
      {
        "id": "ledger",
        "hash": "33f2a1d5b5570c7a8ef30743d1b855243a9a6fe662a5b9cb78cf255e1e267fcf",
        "text": "{\"kind\":\"permit_issued\",\"permit_id\":\"p-1\",...}\n{\"kind\":\"permit_consumed\",\"permit_id\":\"p-1\",...}\n{\"kind\":\"permit_receipt\",\"permit_id\":\"p-1\",\"cost_usd\":1.0,...}"
      },
      {
        "id": "test",
